        <mxCell id="seqnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Recovery semantics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Completed idempotency key returns the existing result; running key returns 202 + operation ID. Reload polls operation status.&lt;br&gt;No automatic provider retry after ambiguous timeout. Unknown spend stays reserved until reconciled; explicit retry uses a new key.&lt;br&gt;A refreshed page may recover a committed answer. Stale lease holders cannot commit. Provider execution is not claimed to be exactly-once." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1460" width="1480" height="120" />
        </mxCell>
